PaddleOCR model attribution
============================

The PDF Tools local OCR engine in this app is PaddleOCR (PP-OCRv6, tiny
tier) running on ONNX Runtime. The model files bundled in this folder:

  PP-OCRv6_tiny_det.onnx   - text detection model
  PP-OCRv6_tiny_rec.onnx   - text recognition model
  ppocrv6_tiny_dict.txt    - recognition character dictionary

are from the ppu-paddle-ocr-models repository
(https://github.com/PT-Perkasa-Pilar-Utama/ppu-paddle-ocr-models),
which redistributes PaddleOCR models converted to ONNX. PaddleOCR
(https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR) is Copyright (c) 2020
PaddlePaddle and is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The ppu-paddle-ocr JavaScript/Kotlin-port ecosystem
(https://www.npmjs.com/package/ppu-paddle-ocr) is MIT licensed;
this app's pipeline is an independent Kotlin port of its PP-OCR
processing math so the Android and web editions behave alike.

